  "text": "Page 21 of 12/ R 30.00 6 S0.00 1 50.D0 aear CreeN\nSection 17. Certification\nThe Clear Creek County Clerk and Recorder shall certify to the passage of this Resolution\nand shall have on file copies of this Resolution for inspection by the public during business hours.\nSection 18.Effective Date\nThis Resolution is effective immediately upon adoption by the Board of County\nCommissioners for Clear Creek County and shall apply to offenses occurring or committed on or\nafter said date of adoption.\nSection 19. Rescission of Resolution 19-14\nResolution 19-14 is rescinded effective the Effective Date.\nADOPTED this 15t day of August, 2023, at a regularly scheduled meeting of the Clear\nCreek County Board of County Commissioners.\nRandall Wheloeklar\nRandall P. Wheelock, Chairman\nHorge Maulis\neorge Marlin, Commissioner\nSenCwaO\nSean C. Wood, Commissioner\nATTEST:\nanAutha\nDeputy Clerk and Recorder\nFor Brenda L. Corbett\nClear Creek County Clerk and Recorder\nPage 21\n2023-17 Licensing Keeping Control Of Dogs Other Animals F08152023.Docx",
